  m_Text: 'Controls:

    >Left - Right - Up - Down : Controls for Car.


    Game
    Instruction:

    >There are three distinct modes: two are racing modes, and
    the third is a simulator mode. In the simulator mode, you must navigate through
    challenges such as dodging mine bombs and evading attacks from spaceships. Skillfully
    maneuver to avoid these obstacles and conquer the mode.'
